error[E4001]: use of moved value `once`
 --> tests/moves/fail/E4001_once_named_function.tarn:6:11
  |
5 |     print(once(1))
  |           ------- value moved here
6 |     print(once(2))
  |           ^^^^^^^ value used here after move
